# Kyren Legate's AlternativeCost needs both halves of its CheckSVar$ chain
# (StaticAbility.java:462-512): the opponent controls a Plains (X) but the
# human controls no Mountain (Y), so the free cast is not offered and no
# cast-option choice is asked (an unanswered one would stop the run). The
# Legate is cast for {1}{R} from Shivan Oasis and a Forest.
startturn human
advance 3
queue manacolor R
queue action human manaability 3 0
passpriority
tapformana human 2 G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 1
resolvestack
